116	     * Remembers which owner was created for each already-seen idempotency key, so a repeated create
117	     * carrying a key seen before returns the originally created owner instead of creating a duplicate.
118	     */
119	    private final Map<String, Integer> idempotentCreations = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
